# Wireframe: Issue Detail

## Purpose & Flow Context

Read-only detail view of a single issue with comments and metadata. Entry: click issue row in Issue List. Exit: back button → Issue List; Edit button → Issue Form modal.

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. 4px cadence.

**App-shell**: Standard shell.

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Back nav | "← Issues" link | Top of content area |
| Issue header | Title, status badge, priority, identifier | Read-only metadata |
| Description | Markdown-rendered description | Editable via "Edit" |
| Comments | Threaded comment list + comment input | At bottom |
| Side metadata | Assignee, due date, labels, attachments | Right column (3 cols) on desktop |

**Content hierarchy**:
1. Issue header — identity + status
2. Side metadata — key fields at a glance
3. Description — main content
4. Comments — discussion

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ← Issues                                             [Edit] [🔗] |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [In Progress]  ⚠ Jul 25    LAG-122                                |
|  # Set up CI pipeline                                               |
|  Priority: [!! High]                                                |
|  Assignee: [👤 Juan Carlos Lagoria]                                |
|  _____________________________________________________________     |
|  Description                                                        |
|  ...rendered markdown...                                            |
|  _____________________________________________________________     |
|  Comments                                                           |
|  +-- 👤 Juan Carlos — 2h ago ----+                                 |
|  |  Started working on this.      |                                 |
|  +-------------------------------+                                 |
|  |  💬 Add a comment...          |                                 |
|  +-------------------------------+                                 |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Back link | Button (link variant) | Click → Issue List, clears selectedIssueId | — |
| Edit | Button | Opens Issue Form modal with pre-populated data | Disabled during loading |
| Status badge | Badge | Color-coded by status | — |
| Priority icon | Icon (flag) | Colored by level | — |
| Avatar | Avatar | User image or initials fallback | — |
| Description | Rendered markdown | Read-only, prose style | Long content scrolls within panel |
| Comment list | List | Threaded, newest-first | Empty → "No comments yet" |
| Comment input | Input + Button | Multiline text, submit on Enter | Empty submit disabled |
| Labels | Badge (tag) | Colored label pills | Overflow → "+N more" |

## Data Display

Metadata panel (right column on desktop, full-width on mobile):

- Assignee (Avatar + name)
- Due date (text, ⚠ if overdue)
- Labels (badge list)
- Attachments (file list with names)
- Parent/child issues (linked list)
- Created date

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| "← Issues" | Back navigation | Consistent across all detail views |
| Issue identifier | Reference ID | LAG-NNN format |
| "Description" | Section heading for main content | — |
| "Comments" | Section heading for discussion | — |
| Comment placeholder | "Add a comment..." | Multiline input |
| Empty comments | "No comments yet" | Distinguish from loading |

## States

### Populated (Default)

Full detail view with description and comments as shown.

### Loading

Skeleton layout — title bar, metadata placeholders, content blocks.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ← Issues                                             [Edit] [🔗] |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [=====]  [===]    [=======]                                      |
|  # [=====================================================]        |
|  [====] [=======]                                                 |
|  Description                                                      |
|  [========================================================]       |
|  [========================================================]       |
|  Comments                                                         |
|  [===== skeleton comment row =====]                               |
|  [===== skeleton comment row =====]                               |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Error

Issue failed to load.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [!] Could not load this issue. It may have been deleted.        |
|                                     [← Back to Issues]           |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Empty (Comments)

No comments yet — shown with empty state below the description.

```
|  Comments                                                         |
|  [💬 Icon]                                                       |
|  No comments yet                                                  |
|  [Add a comment...]                                              |
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Two-column layout: main (9 cols) + metadata (3 cols) |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Metadata moves below description |
| Mobile (<768px) | Single column; back link → back button in header; edit → icon in header |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | `main`, `aside` (metadata region), `section` (comments) |
| Heading order | h1 (issue title) → h2 "Description" → h2 "Comments" |
| Reading / Focus order | Back → issue header → metadata → description → comments → input |
| Accessible names | "Edit issue", "Back to issues", "Add comment" |
| Keyboard operability | Tab through metadata, Enter on Edit, type in comment input |
| Target size | Back link, Edit button, each comment action ≥24×24 CSS px |
| Focus not obscured | — |
| Non-color intent | Status badge includes text, labels include text |

*Defer to design-system: pixel contrast, focus-appearance, per-component target-size/keyboard.*
